      0 ≤ trans3 leaf10Coeff 10 7 3 ((5/16) : ℚ) ((5/16) : ℚ) ((15/64) : ℚ) ((15/64) : ℚ) ((1/4) : ℚ) ((1/4) : ℚ) i j k := by
